  "residual": "Actual coupling-cost-infimum metric and completeness of probability measures with finite first moments on a complete separable Borel metric space. Zero-distance separation, countable conditional-kernel gluing, prescribed coordinate and adjacent joint marginals, measurable almost-sure limits, first moments and transport tail bounds are proved. General optimal-coupling attainment and invariant-law/ergodic conclusions are separate theorems."
